/* ---------- OR · חדר ניתוח (31/10/2026): the operating-room module, ported from the department system's GEAR and adapted to Surgery X ----------
 * Data: the cases stay in the weekly plan (week:<sunday>.days[d].or[i]: proc[j] 'name@ap', cx[j]), so the weekly plan, SLATE, the bank (Flow) and OR read the same cases.
 * cx[j]: k (the operation the details belong to), s (surgeons), sg (a surgeon a secretary suggested), e (equipment), n (prep notes), st (positioning and room setup),
 *   pc (the procedure card), sn (the surgeons' notes), du (minutes), w (wing n/s), bk (the bank case, team|id).
 * Keys: or:cards, or:equip, or:gear (managers, SLATE hours and capacities, the Thursday and daily flags), or:thread:<sunday> (messages, ✓ נקלט, ✓ ראיתי, ✓ הוכן),
 *   or:sp:<pid> (a surgeon's own cards), or:daily, or:phx and or:ph:<h> (photos of catalog items), or:seed (the demo was filled).
 * Who: the owner and the OR managers (default: the deputy head) manage everything; the head of the department and the secretaries build the plan;
 *   the OR head nurse (ornurse) and the OR team (orteam) see the plan, mark ✓ and write in the thread. No patient details anywhere (gearPhi_).
 * This file loads after WebApp.js (and in the demo after the mock) and wraps a few core functions at the end. */
